            "review_title": "Review at Mẹ Ỉn Noodles",
            "review_text": "mslymfl\nToronto, Canada172 contributions\n0\nhave to try the crispy fried pho (rice noodles) with beef\nMar 2026 • Couples\nbếp mẹ ỉn and mẹ ỉn noodle are co-owned and you can order from either menu in either seating area. Really good food. Bếp mẹ ỉn is more known for their beef pancake, which was good but not as good as the ones we had in danang.\n\nMẹ ỉn noodle was awesome. You have to try the crispy fried pho (rice noodles) with beef. It was one of the best things we had in vietnam. The beef was good quality and the crispy noodles were so good. We also had the pho tossed with hoisin sauce (chicken breast fried with noodles). Really good food, and good quality. We went both nights!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 2, 2026",
